{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國佐治亞州亞特蘭大警方11月18日在官方X賬號提及即將發售的《GTA6/俠盜獵車6》，提醒公眾不要混淆虛擬娛樂與現實行為。警方強調，遊戲舞台是虛構的，但亞特蘭大真實存在，玩家不應把遊戲中的犯罪行為帶進城市生活。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586946.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:24:07.057152+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:07:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:20.129044+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:20.129044+00:00","content_hash":"897a59c49f54fa0cae3efd7fc23fc7159bca8de63a0b6d1140694fc879293160","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}